    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 200,
        "content": "## Engagement read-back (stretch goal)\nEvery 6 hours: read every row of `pw_post_log` with status `published`, ask the Facebook Graph API for reactions, comments and shares of that post, and upsert one row per post into `pw_engagement`. Needs `pages_read_engagement` on the Page token."
